[node name="Level" type="Node2D" unique_id=1319451150]
script = ExtResource("1_tcgv6")
hud = "THE WHIP - THE CRAG   (--level crag.tscn)   a gorge, nine drops, the rock decides which throws survive
SPACE / LMB = CLOSE YOUR HAND on the rope. A wrap only takes in the moment you close it,
and only holds while you hold. OPEN your hand and you leave the anchor that instant.
Rock cannot be wrapped - only the anchors hold. Green ring = it holds. Amber = it betrays."

